# Compatibil cu IntelliJ HTTP Client / extensia REST Client.
# Schimbă baseUrl la http://127.0.0.1:8081 pentru procesul baseline.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Health — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Starea casei — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/home

### Pornire bec — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"set-light-power","deviceId":"living-light","power":true}

### Temperatură — 501 în starter, 200 după taskul #5
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"set-target-temperature","deviceId":"living-thermostat","temperature":22}

### Scenariu — 501 în starter, 200 după taskul #6
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenes/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"leave-home","commands":[{"type":"set-light-power","deviceId":"living-light","power":false},{"type":"set-target-temperature","deviceId":"living-thermostat","temperature":18}]}

### Device necunoscut — 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"set-light-power","deviceId":"missing","power":true}

### Scenariu invalid — 422, commandIndex 1, fără modificări
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenes/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"invalid-middle","commands":[{"type":"set-light-power","deviceId":"living-light","power":true},{"type":"set-target-temperature","deviceId":"living-thermostat","temperature":100}]}
